I have found the funniest message in the game (IMHO, of course).

I will not post it -- you have to find it for yourself.
(Perhaps someone else out there will find it and post it, but I
think you really do have to see this for yourself).

Here's how you get the message:

There is an option called fruit which lets you set your favorite 
kind of fruit (instead of slime mold).  To change it (I guess this 
might be different on different machines) press O and then type
fruit:kiwi (for example).

To get this message type:
Ofruit:1
Ofruit:2
Ofruit:3
...                 [continue up to]
Ofruit:101

You don't actually have to type it as show above, you have to change 
the fruit over one hundred times.

No, this is not just a trick to get you to waste time.
